			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Align entry and lifecycle hooks with explicit PascalCase qualification\n\nUpdate AppLifecycle.rs and Entry.rs to enforce strict PascalCase naming and explicit function qualification across the binary initialization path. Replace direct struct calls with the `::Fn()` pattern (e.g., `NowNano::Fn()`, `InitEager::Fn()`) and migrate DNS command imports to their specific submodule paths (`StartupTime`, `dns_get_server_info::dns_get_server_info`) to resolve symbol shadowing.\n\nIntegrate the `HydrateRuntimeEnvironment` step in the boot sequence before PostHog initialization to ensure child processes (Cocoon, Sky) inherit identical telemetry configurations. Initialize the shared dual-pipe telemetry stack for internal libraries (Echo, Mist, Common) to unify observability. Adjust Tauri command registration to explicitly reference handler functions, ensuring consistency with the project's modularized `Binary::Build` and `Command` architecture.",
			"SHA": "ce58c8dc114b552a429754ce9c6cbc763fbbd0e1"
