			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove legacy PermissionManager module\n\nDelete the `Source/IPC/Security/PermissionManager.rs` file as part of the ongoing modularization and cleanup of the IPC security layer. This removal follows the recent pattern of decomposing monolithic IPC modules into fine-grained sub-files and enforcing strict PascalCase naming conventions.\n\nThe functionality previously housed in this file has either been migrated to dedicated sub-modules or is no longer required by the current `EnhancedIPC` architecture. This deletion reduces code clutter and aligns the security implementation with the project's structural evolution.",
